From eb72341fb163a5e288310824163518219d22df9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yehonatan5785 <yehonatan@mail.ru>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 11:15:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] base: reduce unnecessary debug and log spam, part 2

Backport the Android 17 log-spam cleanup to Android 16.

Disable or gate routine debug and verbose logging across frameworks/base,
SystemUI, media, telephony, wallpaper, Bluetooth, sensors, navigation,
incidentd, and related framework components.

Preserve meaningful warnings, errors, security diagnostics, crash
reporting, hardware failures, timeouts, tracing, blur behaviour, and
functional runtime behaviour.

Skip Android 17-only code paths that are not present in the Android 16
framework implementation.

Signed-off-by: yehonatan5785 <yehonatan@mail.ru>
